- Env vars via `process.env` (server) and `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix (client) — never hardcode API URLs
<% } else if (webFramework === 'nuxtjs') { -%>
- Pages, components, routing (file-based routing)
- Tailwind CSS or Nuxt UI for styling
- Data fetching: `useFetch()` / `useAsyncData()` composables
- State management: Pinia for global state
- Env vars via `runtimeConfig` in `nuxt.config.ts` — never hardcode API URLs
<% } else if (webFramework === 'svelte') { -%>
- Pages, components, routing (SvelteKit file-based routing)
- Tailwind CSS for styling
- Data fetching: SvelteKit load functions + fetch
- State management: Svelte stores (writable, derived)
- Env vars via `$env/static/public` or `$env/dynamic/private` — never hardcode API URLs
<% } -%>

