## JWT handling

<% if (modules.mobile) { %>
### Mobile
<% if (mobileFramework === 'expo-rn-nativewind') { -%>
- Store JWT in `expo-secure-store` — non-negotiable
- Never store tokens in AsyncStorage (unencrypted)
- Handle 401 globally — auto-redirect to login
- Attach Bearer token via axios interceptor or fetch wrapper
<% } else if (mobileFramework === 'flutter') { -%>
- Store JWT in `flutter_secure_storage` — non-negotiable
- Never store tokens in SharedPreferences (unencrypted)
- Handle 401 globally — auto-redirect to login
- Attach Bearer token via Dio interceptor or http client wrapper
<% } -%>
<% } %>
<% if (modules.web) { %>
### Web
<% if (webFramework === 'nextjs') { -%>
- Store JWT in httpOnly cookies (set by backend) — non-negotiable for server-side security
- Handle 401 globally — redirect to login via middleware
- Attach credentials via fetch with `credentials: 'include'`
<% } else { -%>
- Store JWT securely (httpOnly cookies preferred, or localStorage with XSS protections)
- Handle 401 globally — auto-redirect to login
- Attach Bearer token via axios interceptor or fetch wrapper
<% } -%>
<% } %>

